@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Public template gallery (no token needed)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/templates

### All templates including hidden ones (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/templates/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One template with its data
GET http://localhost:3001/api/templates/12

### Hide a template (admin only)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/templates/12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
